      "writtenOn": "2017-09-01T17:01:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s still not clear whether resetting each TCPC is necessary or better. For example, I suppose resetting TCPC will cause power loss for Fizz running on type-c power.\n\nI raised my concern here:\nhttps://docs.google.com/a/google.com/document/d/1uzS0b3O3Us1QI2Sx7LDkjEfHmuhYB2BolrAoNwCVoc0/edit?disco\u003dAAAAA_x0NrI",
      "parentUuid": "9b6e549b_49fb4c2d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2303,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 2303,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "1ba98fd13d2844160d5934098515a50c4762b148",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "004fabd0_79ab571a",
        "filename": "common/usb_pd_protocol.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
